<plain>
<text x="342.9" y="7.62" size="2.54" layer="94">D-BS-BM8-L-03</text>
<text x="342.9" y="27.94" size="2.54" layer="94">Control Timing</text>
<text x="419.1" y="7.62" size="2.54" layer="94">A</text>
<text x="256.54" y="86.36" size="1.778" layer="94">When installing additional memory fields, move</text>
<text x="256.54" y="83.82" size="1.778" layer="94">jumpers K2, P2, and U2 to enable BEMA when</text>
<text x="251.46" y="86.36" size="1.778" layer="94">**</text>
<text x="256.54" y="81.28" size="1.778" layer="94">highest available field is selected.</text>
<text x="256.54" y="76.2" size="1.778" layer="94">To protect</text>
<text x="259.08" y="73.66" size="1.778" layer="94">field</text>
<text x="271.78" y="76.2" size="1.778" layer="94">Jumper pins</text>
<text x="271.78" y="73.66" size="1.778" layer="94">K2</text>
<text x="276.86" y="73.66" size="1.778" layer="94">P2</text>
