<text x="281.94" y="68.58" size="1.778" layer="94">V2</text>
<text x="256.54" y="50.8" size="1.778" layer="94">To install on 8/L with existing MC8/LA memory,</text>
<text x="256.54" y="48.26" size="1.778" layer="94">change E2-D2 jumper to E2-F2.</text>
<text x="251.46" y="50.8" size="1.778" layer="94">***</text>
<text x="251.46" y="152.4" size="1.778" layer="94">**</text>
<text x="251.46" y="167.64" size="1.778" layer="94">***</text>
<text x="96.52" y="144.78" size="1.778" layer="94">(350)</text>
<text x="208.28" y="198.12" size="1.778" layer="94">*</text>
<text x="213.36" y="198.12" size="1.778" layer="94">These circuits are wired to common substrates</text>
<text x="213.36" y="195.58" size="1.778" layer="94">for temperature tracking.</text>
